{%- comment -%}
  Product card — the aside beside the price.

  **This block carries its own words and does not obey
  `settings.show_tax_note`**, which reverses a rule CLAUDE.md states plainly:
  "One switch, and it is `settings.show_tax_note`. Every surface obeys it and
  none can override it, so 'is it on?' has exactly one answer." That rule was
  written after three section-level toggles made the shop-wide one hard to
  trust, and it still governs `snippets/tax-note.liquid` and every surface that
  renders it — the collection grid, the search rows, the quick view, the bag
  drawer and the cart page.

  The reversal is deliberate and its scope is exactly one section's card, on
  request. What changes with it: a merchant who turns the shop-wide note off
  now has to remove this block as well, or Most Loved will still carry a note
  the rest of the shop has dropped. That is the cost, and it is the cost the
  rule was written to prevent — so it is worth being able to see it here rather
  than discovering it on the storefront.

  **Do not reintroduce a section-level toggle**, which is a different thing and
  still banned: a checkbox that ANDs with the shop-wide switch gives "is it
  on?" two answers. A block is present or it is not.

  It renders nothing when its text is cleared, so emptying the setting is how
  the note is turned off without removing the block.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The leading space is real, and it is the same one `tax-note.liquid` emits: on
  screen the gap comes from the layout group's own `column-gap`, but a block
  dropped straight into the caption sits inline with the price, and without it
  the markup reads `$19.99inc. all taxes` to a screen reader and to anything
  that copies the text.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
  <small class="price-tax" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}> {{ block.settings.text }}</small>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_tax_note.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:blocks.product_card_tax_note.text.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.product_card_tax_note.text.info",
      "default": "inc. all taxes"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.product_card_tax_note.name",
      "settings": {
        "text": "inc. all taxes"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
